<h1>Capture Point</h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p class="Description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> Capture Point allows a datum point to be captured using the localiser probe. It is used to get the co-ordinates of feature points on the object or to check the localiser calibration (see <u style="text-decoration:none;">Localiser Calibration section</u> for details) Another application of this command is to build datum alignments from point, line, and plane, from known points, or from three points. This command is accessible from the Localiser <i style="font-style:normal;">Menu Datum &gt; Point</i>.</p>
<h2><span lang="EN-GB">Capture Point Wizard</span></h2>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">When</span> <span class="Path">Datum &gt; Point</span> <span class="Path" style="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal;">is selected</span> <span lang="EN-GB">from the localiser menu, the following dialogue will appear:</span></p>
<p><img src="../images/capture.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button one or more times to collect the necessary points. Hold</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'B'</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to delete the last captured point if necessary. Press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to finish.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">If Tolerance check is enabled and the next point is out-of-tolerance KUBE will play warning sound and will display out-of-tolerance value in yellow. See <a href="../../References/Preferences_-_Datums_-_Form_Tolerances.htm">System &gt; Preferences &gt; Datums &gt; Form Tolerances</a> for details.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">If more than one point is captured, KUBE will fit a point from the set of the captured points. The following information about the resulting point will be displayed:</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">co-ordinates of the point.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">maximum distance between the captured points (Max distance will be zero if you captured one point only).</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">RMS of the fitting (RMS will be zero if you captured one point only).</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP936290345" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../images/capture_point.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to reject the resulting point or '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to create it.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Note" id="p1"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span>: If Stream of points method is used then a datum point is created each time the <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'B'</b></span> button is pressed and no Accept/Reject dialog appears. See <span lang="EN-GB"><a href="../../References/Preferences_-_Datums_-_Capture_Method.htm">System &gt; Preferences &gt; Datums &gt; Capture Method (Point Capture Method)</a> for details.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">After finishing the capture procedure, KUBE will issue a dialog, asking you if you will continue capturing points.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a2" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP224152698" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../images/continue.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to exit the capture mode or '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to continue capturing.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
